    "title": "Measurement of the $P_1$ and $P_5'$ angular parameters of the decay $\\\\mathrm{B}^0 \\\\to \\\\mathrm{K}^{*0} \\\\mu^+ \\\\mu^-$ in proton-proton collisions at $\\\\sqrt{s}=8~\\\\mathrm{TeV}$",
    "arxiv": "[CMS-PAS-BPH-15-008v1](https://inspirehep.net/files/cd415975116023c32a00a196839d3068)",
    "time": "2017.06.01",
    "abstract": "A preliminary measurement of the $P_1$ and $P_5'$ angular parameters in the decay $B^0 \\\\to K^{*0} \\\\mu^+ \\\\mu^-$ is performed using proton-proton collision data at $\\\\sqrt{s} = 8$ TeV, corresponding to an integrated luminosity of 20.5 fb$^{-1}$ collected by the CMS experiment. The observables are extracted from a simultaneous fit to the four-dimensional distribution of the decay products in seven bins of the dimuon invariant mass squared. (CMS Physics Analysis Summary CMS-PAS-BPH-15-008)",
